names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Lorenzi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Remington</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Schachter</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sapra</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Randomized, double-blind comparison of the efficacy of two hyaluronic acid derivatives, restylane perlane and hylaform, in the treatment of nasolabial folds</article-title><source>Dermatol Surg</source><year>2005</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>1591</fpage><lpage>1598</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Carruthers A, Carey W, De Lorenzi C, Remington K, Schachter D, Sapra S (2005) Randomized, double-blind comparison of the efficacy of two hyaluronic acid derivatives, restylane perlane and hylaform, in the treatment of nasolabial folds. Dermatol Surg 31:1591&#x02013;1598, discussion 1598 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16416643</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Claoue</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Rabineau</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The polyalkylimide gel: experience with Bio-Alcamid</article-title><source>Semin Cutan Med Surg</source><year>2004</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>236</fpage><lpage>240</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.sder.2004.08.001</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Claoue BL, Rabineau P (2004) The polyalkylimide gel: experience with Bio-Alcamid. Semin Cutan Med Surg 23:236&#x02013;240 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15745232</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Coleman</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Structural fat grafting: more than a permanent filler</article-title><source>Plast Reconstr Surg</source><year>2006</year><volume>118</volume><fpage>108S</fpage><lpage>120S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.prs.0000234610.81672.e7</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Coleman SR (2006) Structural fat grafting: more than a permanent filler. Plast Reconstr Surg 118:108S&#x02013;120S <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16936550</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR13"><label>13.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cunningham</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Mentor Core study on silicone MemoryGel breast implants</article-title><source>Plast Reconstr Surg</source><year>2007</year><volume>120</volume><fpage>19S</fpage><lpage>29S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.prs.0000286574.88752.04</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Cunningham B (2007) The Mentor Core study on silicone MemoryGel breast implants. Plast Reconstr Surg 120:19S&#x02013;29S, discussion 30S&#x02013;32S <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18090810</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pedroza</surname><given-names>LV</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fat transplantation to the buttocks and legs for aesthetic enhancement or correction of deformities: long-term results of large volumes of fat transplant</article-title><source>Dermatol Surg</source><year>2000</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>1145</fpage><lpage>1149</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1524-4725.2000.00276.x</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">de Pedroza LV (2000) Fat transplantation to the buttocks and legs for aesthetic enhancement or correction of deformities: long-term results of large volumes of fat transplant. Dermatol Surg 26:1145&#x02013;1149 <pub-